  "pitch_paragraph": "The hook is the restrained part — the record pulls all the way down to about a third of full height for a full seven seconds before each chorus, and then the chorus itself stays deliberately held back rather than exploding. That inversion is the whole idea and it is genuinely distinctive: the tension comes from what the arrangement withholds, and it makes the section that follows at 2:16 land as the biggest moment in the song. The topline sits low and conversational, living between A♯3 and G♯4 with a reach to E5, so it favours delivery and intimacy in the body with the top end available when it wants it. Bright and open, with room to layer.",
